Third-party code

ArtApp builds on crates from these projects, used as Cargo dependencies pinned by git revision:

PhotoCraft (https://github.com/storytold/photocraft) — photocraft-geom, photocraft-color,
photocraft-raster, photocraft-paint (brush engine, tiled surfaces, blend modes).
Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the PhotoCraft contributors. MIT OR Apache-2.0.

VectorCraft (https://github.com/storytold/vectorcraft) — vectorcraft-geom, vectorcraft-doc,
vectorcraft-render, vectorcraft-pathops, vectorcraft-tools, vectorcraft-color (vector document
model, rendering, path simplification). crates/artapp-core/src/vector.rs adapts the freehand fitting
of VectorCraft's Pencil (engine/src/cmd/draw2/freehand.rs).
Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the VectorCraft contributors. MIT OR Apache-2.0.

egui / epaint (https://github.com/emilk/egui) — third_party/epaint is a copy of epaint 0.37.0 with
one fix (see third_party/epaint/ARTAPP-PATCH.md). Copyright (c) 2018-2021 Emil Ernerfeldt. MIT OR
Apache-2.0 (third_party/epaint/LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE).

